# Cargo's build output. Idiomatically ignored beside the crate rather than only at the repo
# root, so the crate stays correct if it is ever moved or vendored somewhere else.
/target

# Ledger snapshots the Soroban test harness writes on every `cargo test` — 512 KB of JSON
# describing the state each test ran against. They are a debugging aid, they are regenerated
# whenever a test changes, and committing them would put a large, churning diff in front of
# every review of a twelve-line contract change.
/test_snapshots
